@node Interfaces
@chapter Interfaces
@cindex interface control document
@cindex ICD

This chapter is the interface control document (Standard §23.2;
ESC-SRS-089).  It was drafted at gate G2 and is completed in M5; it is
frozen at G3.  Every interface has its own version, which changes only when
the interface does.  Data interfaces carry a committed JSON Schema under
@file{schemas/}, which the tests validate against.  An interface with no
declared class would be stable by default; every one here declares one.

@menu
* Interface inventory::   Every interface, its version and class.
* CLI interface::         Commands, global flags, output, errors, exit codes.
* Configuration format::  The TOML file and the mapping grammar.
* Environment interface:: Variables Escape Pod reads.
@end menu

